  'Glass, toughened and laminated' => ['Glass', 'Toughened glass is heat-treated to be several times stronger than ordinary glass and breaks into small blunt pieces. Laminated glass has a plastic interlayer that holds broken pieces together. Use them for shower screens, railings and table tops.'],
  'Granite'                 => ['Stone', 'A hard igneous stone that handles heat and scratches well, which is why it is India\'s most common kitchen countertop. Polished, honed and leathered finishes are available; reseal every year or two.'],
